#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:678
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Leave him behind"
msgstr "두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:686
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "CHRONO-TRIGGERED"
msgstr "시간에 갇히다"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:690
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
" hears a crack whilst walking through the city. When they turn around, "
msgstr "은(는) 도시를 걷다가 뭔가 깨지는 소리를 듣는다. 뒤돌아보니, "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:690
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " is frozen."
msgstr "이(가) 얼어붙어 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:691
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "The other members wait patiently. Hours pass. "
msgstr "다른 일행은 참을성 있게 기다린다. 몇 시간이 지난다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:691
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " doesn't even react to being prodded in the clock-hand."
msgstr "은(는) 시곗바늘로 쿡쿡 찔러도 반응조차 없다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:692
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "It seems "
msgstr "보아하니 "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:692
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
" carelessly stepped on their watch whilst walking, freezing them in time "
msgstr "은(는) 걷다가 부주의하게 자기 시계를 밟아, 시간 속에 갇혀 버린 것 같다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:692
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "FOREVER AND EVER."
msgstr "영원히, 영원히."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:694
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
" is walking through a forest when they carelessly step on their watch. Time "
"grinds to a halt around them."
msgstr "은(는) 숲을 걷다가 부주의하게 자기 시계를 밟는다. 주변의 시간이 멈춰 버린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:695
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"Their watch is permanently broken! No matter what they do, the world simply "
"doesn't respond. The entire world is frozen in time."
msgstr "시계가 영영 망가졌다! 무슨 짓을 해도 세상은 아무 반응이 없다. 온 세상이 시간 속에 얼어붙었다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:696
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " is trapped in a chronological prison of their own making!"
msgstr "은(는) 스스로 만든 시간의 감옥에 갇혔다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:698
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Oh well! "
msgstr "뭐, 어쩔 수 없지! "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:698
#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:712
#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:754
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " has left the team!"
msgstr "이(가) 일행을 떠났다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:705
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "SURVIVAL OF THE STINKIEST"
msgstr "가장 냄새나는 자의 생존"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:709
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " is resting when "
msgstr "이(가) 쉬고 있는데 "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:709
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "'s pet rushes in, irritated."
msgstr "의 애완동물이 잔뜩 성이 나서 뛰어든다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:710
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "The stressed spider attacks the team! It almost devours "
msgstr "스트레스 받은 거미가 일행을 공격한다! 하마터면 먹힐 뻔한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:711
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "It takes hours to get the creature under control. "
msgstr "그 생물을 진정시키는 데 몇 시간이 걸린다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:711
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " storms away in a huff!"
msgstr "은(는) 씩씩대며 떠나 버린다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:715
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " is walking when their pet attacks out of nowhere!"
msgstr "은(는) 걷다가 난데없이 자기 애완동물에게 공격당한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:716
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "The stressed, ravenous spider pins "
msgstr "스트레스 받고 굶주린 거미가 "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:716
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " down! There's nowhere to escape!"
msgstr "을(를) 짓누른다! 도망칠 곳이 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:717
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " doesn't stand a chance against the raw strength of their pet. "
msgstr "는 애완동물의 순수한 힘 앞에 상대가 안 된다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:717
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " is devoured!"
msgstr "이(가) 잡아먹힌다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:727
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "RUNAWAY REFRIDGERATOR"
msgstr "폭주하는 냉장고"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:731
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " can only think about one thing..."
msgstr "은(는) 딱 한 가지 생각뿐이다..."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:731
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " SMASHING UP POWER BOXES!"
msgstr " 배전함 부수기!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:732
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
" goes on a rampage, smashing up the environment. The team is caught in the "
"chaos!"
msgstr "은(는) 날뛰며 주변을 박살 낸다. 일행이 그 난장판에 휘말린다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:733
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "This intense destruction session burns a significant portion of gas!"
msgstr "이 격렬한 파괴 행각에 기름이 꽤 많이 날아간다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:737
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " has nobody to hold them back from"
msgstr "을(를) 말릴 사람이 아무도 없다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:737
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " SMASHING UP EVERYTHING"
msgstr " 전부 다 부수기"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:737
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " and "
msgstr " 그리고 "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:737
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "DRINKING ALL THE GAS."
msgstr "기름 전부 마시기."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:738
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"Unable to resist their urge, they drink ALL the available gas, gulping it to"
" pulverise a trendy clothes store."
msgstr "충동을 참지 못하고, 있는 기름을 전부 벌컥벌컥 들이켜 그 힘으로 유행 옷가게를 박살 낸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:739
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
" eventually regains clarity some hours later, having damaged themselves "
"lightly in the process."
msgstr "는 몇 시간 뒤에야 겨우 정신을 차린다. 그 과정에서 몸도 조금 다쳤다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:748
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "I JUST WANNA TALK TO HIM..."
msgstr "그냥 그 녀석이랑 얘기하고 싶을 뿐이야..."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:751
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
" thinks back on his life. How did things get so bad? What came first, the "
"bath or the tub? These important question circle the mind. Then, "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 자기 인생을 돌아본다. 어쩌다 이렇게까지 망가졌을까? 욕조가 먼저일까, 목욕이 먼저일까? 이런 중요한 질문들이 머릿속을 맴돈다."
" 그러다 "

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:751
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " realises:"
msgstr "는 깨닫는다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:752
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "THAT DAMNED CHICKEN."
msgstr "그 망할 닭."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:752
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " It may also have been a sheep, dog, or other vague form of animal."
msgstr " 양이나 개, 아니면 다른 막연한 동물이었을 수도 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:753
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " resolves to find and get revenge on the menace!"
msgstr "은(는) 그 원수를 찾아내 복수하기로 결심한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:760
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "LOST ON THE ROCKS"
msgstr "암초 위에서 길을 잃다"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:763
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "As "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:763
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
" drives along, the road becomes increasingly wet. Rain emerges from the "
"clouds."
msgstr "이(가) 달리는 동안, 길이 점점 젖어 간다. 구름에서 비가 쏟아진다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:764
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"Over the course of several minutes, the water level rises rapidly. Huge "
"waves start to form! Many zombies flood inward, carried by the currents."
msgstr "몇 분 사이에 물이 빠르게 불어난다. 거대한 파도가 일기 시작한다! 수많은 좀비가 물살에 실려 밀려든다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:765
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid " is very quiet as all of this unfolds."
msgstr "은(는) 이 모든 일이 벌어지는 동안 아주 조용하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:770
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "Endure The Flood"
msgstr "홍수를 버텨 낸다"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:878
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "raaaWWWRRRRRR!!!!!!"
msgstr "크아아아아아르르르르!!!!!!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:932
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "is just a lost lumberjack. Nothing to see here."
msgstr "은(는) 그냥 길 잃은 나무꾼이다. 볼 거 없다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:980
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"initially didn't realise that a fireman was supposed to FIGHT fire. Lawsuits"
" unrelated!"
msgstr "은(는) 처음엔 소방관이 불과 '싸워야' 한다는 걸 몰랐다. 소송과는 무관하다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:1020
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "the warrior - has met his superior..."
msgstr "전사여 - 자신보다 위대한 자를 만났구나..."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:1080
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"ended up here after invading the wrong island. Geography can be so "
"confusing..."
msgstr "은(는) 엉뚱한 섬을 침공하는 바람에 여기 오게 됐다. 지리는 너무 헷갈린다..."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:1127
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "is unbeaten in matters animal, vegetable or mineral."
msgstr "은(는) 동물, 식물, 광물 분야에서 무패다."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:1157
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid "oops."
msgstr "이런."

#: deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df:1204
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/TRACHEA.df"
msgid ""
"is pretty good at his job, or I wouldn't be discussing it, now would I?"
msgstr "은(는) 자기 일을 꽤 잘한다. 아니면 내가 이 얘길 하고 있겠어?"

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:9 deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " tells "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " to shut it."
msgstr "에게 그만 좀 하라고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " doesn't take this well, and leaves the group in a huff."
msgstr "는 이걸 좋게 받아들이지 않고, 씩씩대며 일행을 떠난다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " gets quiet after "
msgstr "는 조용해진다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " to stop talking, but "
msgstr "에게 말을 그만하라고 했고, "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " isn't very happy about it."
msgstr "는 그게 별로 달갑지 않다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " ignores "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " just fine."
msgstr "을(를) 아주 잘 무시한다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " tries to ignore "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid ", but "
msgstr "을(를) 무시하려 하지만, "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " keeps going and going."
msgstr "는 계속 떠들고 또 떠든다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " continues to rant, and ends up feeling a little better."
msgstr "은(는) 계속 열변을 토하다가, 결국 기분이 조금 나아진다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid "Giant Rant"
msgstr "끝없는 열변"

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " decides to blow off steam by delivering a seemingly endless rant to "
msgstr "은(는) 스트레스를 풀려고 끝없는 열변을 늘어놓는다. 들어야 하는 건: "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid "Try to ignore it"
msgstr "무시해 본다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid "Tell "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " to shut up"
msgstr "에게 닥치라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:51 deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " and "
msgstr "와(과) "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " keep arguing, and by the end of it everyone feels worse."
msgstr "은(는) 계속 말다툼하고, 끝날 무렵엔 모두 기분이 더 나빠진다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid ""
" gets agitated by the argument and drives steadily faster. The argument ends"
" abruptly when "
msgstr "은(는) 말다툼에 흥분해서 점점 속도를 올린다. 말다툼은 갑자기 끝나는데, "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " accidentally rams into a flagpole."
msgstr "가 실수로 깃대를 들이받았기 때문이다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid "The group stops the car and sets up camp near the road, so that "
msgstr "일행은 차를 세우고 길가에 야영한다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " can get some space. This works, but it wastes a day."
msgstr "이(가) 서로 떨어져 있을 수 있도록. 효과는 있지만, 하루를 날린다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " tunes "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " out after awhile, and it's like the argument never happened for "
msgstr "의 말을 한참 지나 흘려듣게 되고, 마치 말다툼이 없었던 것 같다. 적어도 이 사람에겐: "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " gets even less happy."
msgstr "은(는) 더 기분이 나빠진다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:70
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid "Road Trip Arguement"
msgstr "여행길 말다툼"

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid "While driving the car, "
msgstr "운전하던 중, "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " gets into a big arguement with "
msgstr "은(는) 크게 말다툼을 벌인다. 상대는 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid "Keep driving and arguing"
msgstr "계속 운전하며 말다툼한다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:73
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid "Take a break for a day"
msgstr "하루 쉰다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:77
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " doesnt hear "
msgstr "이(가) 못 듣는다: "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " drives faster"
msgstr "이(가) 속도를 높인다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:84
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid "Bullying"
msgstr "괴롭힘"

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:85
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " snaps and starts yelling insults at "
msgstr "은(는) 폭발해서 욕을 퍼붓기 시작한다. 대상은 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " responds by punching "
msgstr "은(는) 주먹으로 응수한다: "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " in the face."
msgstr "의 얼굴에."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " yells back and it turns into a huge fight."
msgstr "은(는) 맞받아 소리치고, 결국 큰 싸움이 된다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " remains diplomatic while being insulted, but it still gets to "
msgstr "은(는) 모욕을 들으면서도 침착하게 대응하지만, 그래도 속이 상하긴 한다. 불쌍한 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:98
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid ""
" was thinking of something else during all the insults, and didn't really "
"hear any of them."
msgstr "은(는) 모욕을 듣는 내내 딴생각을 하느라 하나도 제대로 듣지 못했다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " insults "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " right back, except much more effectively."
msgstr "에게 그대로 욕을 돌려준다. 훨씬 더 효과적으로."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " is very resentful of this, and plans revenge for later."
msgstr "은(는) 이 일에 앙심을 품고 나중에 복수할 계획을 세운다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid " feels very slightly better about "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid "self."
msgstr " 자신에 대해 아주 조금 기분이 나아진다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid "Driving Off the Death Road"
msgstr "데스 로드에서 벗어나다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:112
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid ""
"The team finally gives up. They retreat to an unknown fate.\r\n"
"The journey to Canada is at an end."
msgstr ""
"일행은 마침내 포기한다. 알 수 없는 운명을 향해 물러난다.\r\n"
"캐나다로의 여정은 여기서 끝이다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid "Fatal Argument"
msgstr "치명적인 말다툼"

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid ""
" spends so much effort arguing with each other that they don't notice "
"they've driven into the middle of an overwhelming sea of zombies. A building"
" is nearby, but it seems hopeless..."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 서로 말다툼하느라 너무 정신이 팔려, 압도적인 좀비의 바다 한가운데로 차를 몰고 들어온 걸 눈치채지 못한다. 근처에 건물이 "
"있지만, 가망 없어 보인다..."

#: deathforth/events/despair/argue.df:123
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/argue.df"
msgid "Give up on the journey to Canada"
msgstr "캐나다로의 여정을 포기한다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid "Lost to Despair"
msgstr "절망에 굴복하다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid " has lost all faith in "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid " pack. "
msgstr " 무리에 대한 믿음을 완전히 잃었다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid " sits down and simply refuses to continue on the journey."
msgstr "는 주저앉아 여정을 계속하길 거부한다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid " decides to maul "
msgstr "은(는) 포기하기 전에 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid " real quick before giving up. "
msgstr "을(를) 재빨리 물어뜯기로 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid "One for the road."
msgstr "마지막 한 입."

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid " Attack"
msgstr " 공격"

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid " snaps, seemingly out of nowhere, and mauls "
msgstr "은(는) 난데없이 폭발해서 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid " in a flurry of "
msgstr "을(를) 마구 공격한다: "

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid "ing and "
msgstr " 소리와 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid "The "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid " doesn't seem guilty about this murder. In fact, "
msgstr "은(는) 이 살해에 죄책감이 없어 보인다. 오히려 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid " seems very pleased with "
msgstr "는 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid ""
"self.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
" 자신이 아주 뿌듯한 것 같다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid "Realizing what "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid " did, the "
msgstr "가 저지른 짓을 깨닫고, "

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid " flees and never returns."
msgstr "은(는) 도망쳐 다시는 돌아오지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid " Tantrum"
msgstr " 떼쓰기"

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid " throws a huge tantrum. "
msgstr "은(는) 엄청나게 떼를 쓴다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid ""
" snorts and leaps around in one place. After finishing by ripping up some "
"grass and peeing defiantly, "
msgstr "는 콧김을 뿜으며 제자리에서 펄쩍펄쩍 뛴다. 마지막으로 풀을 뜯어 버리고 보란 듯이 오줌을 싸고 나서, "

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid " feels a little better."
msgstr "는 기분이 조금 나아진다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid "During the tantrum, "
msgstr "떼쓰는 동안, "

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid " took the opportunity to maim "
msgstr "은(는) 틈을 타 다치게 했다: "

#: deathforth/events/despair/dog.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/dog.df"
msgid "These antics were amusing to watch."
msgstr "이 난리는 보는 재미가 있었다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid "COME ON"
msgstr "아 좀"

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " gets kicked out of the group instead of "
msgstr "은(는) 일행에서 쫓겨난다. 원래 쫓겨날 사람은 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:27 deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " smiles a little."
msgstr "은(는) 살짝 미소 짓는다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:31 deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " shrugs."
msgstr "은(는) 어깨를 으쓱한다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:33 deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " feels relieved that "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:33 deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid "'s gone."
msgstr "가 떠나서 안도한다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " recommends that "
msgstr "은(는) 대신 이 사람이 떠나야 한다고 권한다: "

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid ""
" leave, instead.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
".\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " kicks "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid ""
" out for being a dingus.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"을(를) 멍청하게 군 죄로 쫓아낸다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:48
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid ""
" storms off in a huff.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 씩씩대며 떠나 버린다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid ""
" says something along the lines of 'COME ON I WAS JUST JOKING HA HA'.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) '아 왜 그래 농담이었어 하하' 비슷한 말을 한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid ""
" still gets kicked out.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"는 그래도 쫓겨난다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:70
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " was kicked from the group due to "
msgstr "은(는) 일행에서 쫓겨났다. 원인은 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " feels pretty smug about this."
msgstr "은(는) 이 일로 꽤 우쭐하다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " tries to reason with "
msgstr "은(는) 설득해 보려 한다. 상대는 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:80
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " convinces "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:80
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " to calm down. They come to an understanding with each other, for now."
msgstr "을(를) 진정시키는 데 성공한다. 둘은 일단은 서로를 이해하게 된다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " is infuriated by "
msgstr "은(는) 격분한다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid "'s attempt to manipulate "
msgstr "이(가) 감히 조종하려 들다니. 그것도 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " throws a punch at "
msgstr "는 주먹을 날린다: "

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " and stomps off into the night."
msgstr "에게. 그러고는 쿵쿵대며 밤 속으로 사라진다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " tells "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " to"
msgstr "에게 말한다:"

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " SAY IT, DON'T SPRAY IT."
msgstr " 말로 해, 침 튀기지 말고."

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " takes this advice to heart. What if "
msgstr "은(는) 이 조언을 마음에 새긴다. 혹시 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " was always held back by "
msgstr "가 늘 발목 잡혔던 게 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid ""
" habit of 'spraying it instead of saying it'? A tearful emotional "
"breakthrough happens."
msgstr " '말로 하지 않고 침 튀기는' 버릇 때문이었다면? 눈물 어린 감정의 돌파구가 열린다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:93
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " gets so angry about this that "
msgstr "은(는) 이 말에 너무 화가 나서 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:93
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " can't even talk."
msgstr "는 말조차 못 한다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:100
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " talks "
msgstr "이(가) 달랜다: "

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:100
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " down"
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid ": SAY IT DON'T SPRAY IT"
msgstr ": 말로 해, 침 튀기지 말고"

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid "Fight Army of Zombies"
msgstr "좀비 군대와 싸운다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:117
#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid "Back on the Death Road!"
msgstr "다시 데스 로드로!"

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:118
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid ""
"How in the world did you survive that?\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"대체 어떻게 살아남은 거지?\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:119
#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid " gets "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:119
#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid "COMPLETELY PUMPED UP"
msgstr "완전히 의욕이 불타오른다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/logic.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/logic.df"
msgid ""
"Maybe this team isn't so bad after all!\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"어쩌면 이 일행도 그렇게 나쁘진 않을지도!\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid "Lost to Despair"
msgstr "절망에 굴복하다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " has lost all hope, and refuses to keep going. "
msgstr "은(는) 모든 희망을 잃고 더 가기를 거부한다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " wanders off to an unknown fate."
msgstr "는 알 수 없는 운명을 향해 떠나 버린다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid "What a nerd! Who needs "
msgstr "찐따 같으니! 어차피 누가 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid ", anyway?"
msgstr "가 필요하대?"

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid "Everyone Needs to Hustle"
msgstr "모두 제 몫을 해야 한다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:19 deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " says that "
msgstr "은(는) 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid "SOMEONE"
msgstr "누군가"

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid ""
" in the group isn't pulling their weight, and demands that they be kicked out.\r\n"
"\tWho should leave the group?"
msgstr ""
"가 일행에서 제 몫을 못 하고 있다며, 쫓아내야 한다고 요구한다.\r\n"
"\t누가 일행을 떠나야 할까?"

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " ignores "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid ". It turns out that "
msgstr "을(를) 무시한다. 알고 보니 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " didn't hear "
msgstr "는 이 사람 말을 아예 못 들었다: "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " fumes at this!"
msgstr "은(는) 이에 분통을 터뜨린다!"

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid "Ultimatum"
msgstr "최후통첩"

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " demands that either "
msgstr "은(는) 요구한다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " leaves, or "
msgstr "이(가) 떠나든지, "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " does."
msgstr "이(가) 떠나든지."

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " demands that "
msgstr "은(는) 요구한다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " leaves. "
msgstr "이(가) 떠나야 한다고. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " will take the car and supplies and continue on to Canada."
msgstr "가 차와 물자를 챙겨 캐나다로 계속 가겠다고."

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:39 deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " gets kicked out"
msgstr "이(가) 쫓겨난다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " doesn't hear "
msgstr "이(가) 흘려듣는다: "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:48
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid "everyone"
msgstr "모두"

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid "Quietly Disappearing"
msgstr "조용히 사라지기"

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " sneaks off when "
msgstr "은(는) 몰래 빠져나간다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid ""
" is busy.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"이(가) 바쁜 틈을 타서.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid ""
" is a true weasel who steals the keys for the car, intending to take "
"everything for "
msgstr "는 진짜 족제비 같은 놈이라 차 열쇠를 훔친다. 모든 걸 챙겨 갈 생각이다. 오직 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid "self."
msgstr " 자신을 위해."

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " leaves, taking nothing, not even "
msgstr "는 아무것도 챙기지 않고 떠난다. 심지어 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " personal supplies."
msgstr " 개인 물품조차."

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid "There is a note left behind, wishing "
msgstr "쪽지가 남아 있다. 내용은 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " luck!"
msgstr "에게 행운을 빈다는 것!"

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " steals as much food as possible before leaving. "
msgstr "는 떠나기 전에 식량을 최대한 훔친다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid "However, "
msgstr "하지만 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " sensed something was off and followed "
msgstr "은(는) 뭔가 이상한 낌새를 채고 뒤를 밟았다: "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid "The traitor was prevented from stealing the car and everything in it. "
msgstr "배신자가 차와 그 안의 모든 걸 훔치는 건 막았다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " flees."
msgstr "는 달아난다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid ""
"The thief was surprised, and ended up dropping the food while running away."
msgstr "도둑은 놀라서, 도망치다가 식량을 떨어뜨렸다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " drives off with most of the supplies."
msgstr "는 물자 대부분을 챙겨 차를 몰고 가 버린다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:84
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid "Too bad for "
msgstr "안됐군, "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:84
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " that there wasn't any food, anyway."
msgstr ". 어차피 식량은 하나도 없었으니까."

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:87
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid "What little the group had was stolen."
msgstr "얼마 없던 물자마저 도둑맞았다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid "The thief took all "
msgstr "도둑은 챙겨 갔다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/loss.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/loss.df"
msgid " could carry."
msgstr "가 들 수 있는 건 전부."

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "Driving Off the Death Road"
msgstr "데스 로드에서 벗어나다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " finally gives up. "
msgstr "은(는) 마침내 포기한다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid ""
" retreats to an unknown fate.\r\n"
"The journey to Canada is at an end."
msgstr ""
"는 알 수 없는 운명을 향해 물러난다.\r\n"
"캐나다로의 여정은 여기서 끝이다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "Haze of Despair"
msgstr "절망의 안개"

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid ", in a haze of despair, stops paying attention while driving. "
msgstr "은(는) 절망에 빠져 운전 중 정신을 놓는다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " ends up in the middle of a massive horde that "
msgstr "는 거대한 좀비 떼 한가운데에 빠지고 만다. 원래라면 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " could have avoided. A building is nearby, but it seems hopeless..."
msgstr "가 피할 수 있었던 떼다. 근처에 건물이 있지만, 가망 없어 보인다..."

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "Give up on the journey to Canada"
msgstr "캐나다로의 여정을 포기한다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "Road Despair"
msgstr "길 위의 절망"

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "With "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " mind clouded by loneliness and low morale, "
msgstr " 머릿속이 외로움과 낮은 사기로 흐려진 채, "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " ends up crashing the car."
msgstr "은(는) 결국 차를 들이받는다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " is relieved when the car starts up again!"
msgstr "은(는) 차 시동이 다시 걸리자 안도한다!"

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "Losing Strength"
msgstr "근력 상실"

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "The despair and isolation make "
msgstr "절망과 고립 때문에 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " start to lose strength."
msgstr "은(는) 근력을 잃기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "Wasting Away"
msgstr "쇠약"

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "'s body is affected by the stress of this hopeless situation."
msgstr "의 몸이 이 절망적인 상황의 스트레스에 시달린다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "Shaky Hands"
msgstr "떨리는 손"

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid ", under intense pressure, starts to get shaky hands from the stress."
msgstr "은(는) 극심한 압박 속에 스트레스로 손이 떨리기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "Leg Bite"
msgstr "다리 물림"

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "Distracted and alone, "
msgstr "정신이 팔린 채 홀로, "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid ""
" is caught by a crawling zombie while wandering a ruined town.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 폐허가 된 마을을 헤매다 기어 다니는 좀비에게 붙잡힌다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " gets away, but "
msgstr "는 도망치지만, "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " leg is never quite the same."
msgstr " 다리는 예전 같지 않다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "Bitterness"
msgstr "씁쓸함"

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "Wandering alone, "
msgstr "홀로 떠돌며, "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " dwells on the past. "
msgstr "은(는) 과거를 곱씹는다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " becomes bitter in "
msgstr "는 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " isolation."
msgstr " 고립 속에서 점점 씁쓸해진다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "Unseen Tantrum"
msgstr "아무도 못 본 떼쓰기"

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " accidentally slams "
msgstr "은(는) 실수로 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " hand in the car door. In anger, "
msgstr " 손을 차 문에 찧는다. 화가 나서 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " gets out and kicks a tire, stubbing "
msgstr "는 차에서 내려 타이어를 걷어차다가 찧는다: "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " toe. This makes "
msgstr " 발가락을. 그래서 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " BLOW A GASKET."
msgstr "는 완전히 뚜껑이 열린다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "Crushing Boredom"
msgstr "숨 막히는 지루함"

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid "With no one to interact with, "
msgstr "어울릴 사람이 없어서, "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " becomes extremely bored. "
msgstr "은(는) 지독하게 지루해진다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " feels "
msgstr "는 느낀다: "

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " energy and awareness slipping away."
msgstr " 기력과 정신이 빠져나가는 걸."

#: deathforth/events/despair/solo.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/solo.df"
msgid " becomes tired !"
msgstr "은(는) 피곤해졌다!"

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid "'s "
msgstr "의 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid "INCREDIBLE POWERS OF POSITIVE THINKING"
msgstr "긍정적 사고의 놀라운 힘"

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid " kick in, shielding "
msgstr "이 발동한다. 덕분에 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid " from the horrors of reality."
msgstr "는 끔찍한 현실로부터 보호받는다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid "Really, things aren't going too bad here!"
msgstr "사실, 상황이 그렇게 나쁘진 않아!"

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid "Well, things could be worse I guess!"
msgstr "뭐, 더 나쁠 수도 있었겠지!"

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid " gains strength from hope!"
msgstr "는 희망에서 힘을 얻는다!"

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid "'s spirit starts to crack! "
msgstr "의 정신에 금이 가기 시작한다! "

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid " might not be so lucky next time!"
msgstr "는 다음엔 이렇게 운이 좋지 않을지도!"

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid "The Death Road Continues"
msgstr "데스 로드는 계속된다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid " apologizes to "
msgstr "은(는) 미안하다고 한다. 상대는 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid ""
"I can't go on the Death Road any more! Just remember everything I taught you!\r\n"
"\t\t\tYou can do it, I believe in you!"
msgstr ""
"난 더는 데스 로드를 못 가겠어! 내가 가르쳐 준 거 전부 기억해!\r\n"
"\t\t\t넌 할 수 있어, 난 널 믿어!"

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid ""
"s in a very inspirational way.\r\n"
"\t\tThe crown is being passed on, to "
msgstr ""
" 소리를 아주 감동적으로 낸다.\r\n"
"\t\t왕관이 넘어간다. 받는 이는 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid ""
" gets the keys, puts them in the car ignition, and starts it up. Onward to "
"Canada!"
msgstr "은(는) 열쇠를 받아 시동을 건다. 캐나다로 출발!"

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid " Drives Around, All Over the Town"
msgstr "는 마을 여기저기를 차로 누빈다"

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid " never listened to a single thing "
msgstr "는 "

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid " said. "
msgstr "의 말을 하나도 듣지 않았다. "

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid ""
" slowly makes it a few miles down the road, but then drives the car right "
"over a cliff."
msgstr "은(는) 길을 몇 마일 천천히 가다가, 그대로 절벽 아래로 차를 몰고 떨어진다."

#: deathforth/events/despair/sort.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/despair/sort.df"
msgid "CATS DON'T LISTEN"
msgstr "고양이는 말을 안 듣는다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Stash in the Woods"
msgstr "숲속의 은닉처"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid " is driving through the forest at night. "
msgstr "은(는) 밤에 숲을 지나고 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid ""
" takes a wrong turn and hits the end of the road. Nearby to the north, "
msgstr "는 길을 잘못 들어 막다른 길에 닿는다. 북쪽 가까이에, "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid " can barely see the shape of a cabin."
msgstr "는 오두막 형체를 간신히 알아본다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Investigate cabin"
msgstr "오두막을 조사한다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Prepper Cabin"
msgstr "생존주의자의 오두막"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid ""
" knew some people that became crazy preppers long before the zombies happened.\r\n"
"\tTheir cabin is located nearby, and it's still fairly early in the day."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 좀비 사태 훨씬 전에 미친 생존주의자가 된 사람들을 알고 있었다.\r\n"
"\t그들의 오두막이 근처에 있고, 아직 이른 시간이다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Visit the cabin"
msgstr "오두막에 가 본다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Hunting Lodge"
msgstr "사냥 오두막"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid ""
" spots a sign pointing the way to a nearby hunting lodge. In the same "
"direction, some stragglers of a wandering horde are visible. Beware!"
msgstr "은(는) 근처 사냥 오두막으로 가는 표지판을 발견한다. 같은 방향에 떠도는 좀비 떼의 낙오자들이 보인다. 조심해!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Drive to lodge"
msgstr "오두막으로 간다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:37
#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Rest Stop"
msgstr "휴게소"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid ""
" finds a rest stop along the road. It looks very quiet from the outside."
msgstr "은(는) 길가에서 휴게소를 발견한다. 밖에서 보기엔 아주 조용하다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:41
#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Visit Rest Stop"
msgstr "휴게소에 들른다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid ""
" finds a rest stop along the road. Some zombies mill around outside, as if "
"guarding something within."
msgstr "은(는) 길가에서 휴게소를 발견한다. 좀비 몇 마리가 안에 있는 뭔가를 지키는 듯 밖을 서성인다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Junkyard"
msgstr "고물상"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid ""
" spots a junkyard full of garbage and old wrecks. Zombies roam around the "
"trash for reasons you can't spot from here."
msgstr "은(는) 쓰레기와 낡은 폐차로 가득한 고물상을 발견한다. 좀비들이 여기선 알 수 없는 이유로 쓰레기 사이를 돌아다닌다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:59
#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:68
#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:77
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Explore Junkyard"
msgstr "고물상을 탐색한다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Secure Junkyard"
msgstr "경비가 삼엄한 고물상"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid ""
" spots a landfill on the side of the road. A building outside of it has "
"security signs and bars across the windows. Seems like a lot of protection "
"for a junkyard's office."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 길가의 쓰레기 매립지를 발견한다. 그 밖에 있는 건물에는 보안 표지판이 붙어 있고 창문엔 쇠창살이 있다. 고물상 사무실치고는 "
"보안이 지나치게 철저하다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:73
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Junkyard Car Parking"
msgstr "고물상 주차장"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid ""
" spots a junkyard with a car pulled up to the front of it. The car looks "
"like it's in great shape, but where's the owner?"
msgstr "은(는) 앞에 차 한 대가 서 있는 고물상을 발견한다. 차 상태는 아주 좋아 보이는데, 주인은 어디 있지?"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Roadside Nightmare"
msgstr "길가의 악몽"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:83
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid ""
" finds a rest stop along the road, completely overwhelmed with angry undead."
" What could have happened here?"
msgstr "은(는) 길가에서 성난 언데드로 완전히 뒤덮인 휴게소를 발견한다. 여기서 무슨 일이 있었던 걸까?"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Attempt to explore"
msgstr "탐색해 본다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:91
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Roadside Car Stop"
msgstr "길가 정차 차량"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:92
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid ""
" finds a rest stop along the road. Right in front of it is a car that looks "
"like it's been recently driven. The car is in great shape, but the owner is "
"nowhere in sight."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 길가에서 휴게소를 발견한다. 바로 앞에 최근까지 누가 몰았던 것 같은 차가 서 있다. 차 상태는 아주 좋은데, 주인은 보이지 "
"않는다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:95
#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Check out that car"
msgstr "저 차를 살펴본다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:100
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "Car Rental Cabin"
msgstr "렌터카 오두막"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid ""
" finds a car sitting alongside a country road. It's in great shape and seems"
" like it's been recently driven. A cabin is visible a little to the north."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 시골길 옆에 서 있는 차를 발견한다. 상태가 아주 좋고 최근까지 누가 몰았던 것 같다. 조금 북쪽에 오두막이 보인다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "The End of the Death Road"
msgstr "데스 로드의 끝"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:110
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "The border to Canada is just north of here! "
msgstr "캐나다 국경이 바로 북쪽이다! "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:110
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid ""
" must cross the bridge and then reach the fort that serves as a checkpoint "
"right outside of Canada. This is the final challenge! Good luck!"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 다리를 건넌 다음, 캐나다 바로 앞의 검문소 역할을 하는 요새에 도착해야 한다. 이것이 마지막 시험이다! 행운을 빈다!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/cabin1.df"
msgid "YOU CAN MAKE IT!"
msgstr "너흰 해낼 수 있어!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df"
msgid "BAKAAAAAAAW!"
msgstr "꼬끼오오오오오!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df"
msgid "THIS FARM IS DONE FOR, LET'S RUN"
msgstr "이 농장은 끝났어, 도망치자"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df"
msgid "LET'S TRACK DOWN MA!"
msgstr "엄마를 찾으러 가자!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df"
msgid "LET'S GET OUT OF HERE!"
msgstr "여기서 나가자!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df"
msgid "WE NEED TO RESCUE PA!"
msgstr "아빠를 구해야 해!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df"
msgid " fends off zombies for a few hours while turning the pig into food."
msgstr "은(는) 몇 시간 동안 좀비를 막아 내며 돼지를 식량으로 만든다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df"
msgid ""
" could have had a true friend. This was thrown away for some bacon. Was it "
"worth it? Probably, bacon's pretty good."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 진정한 친구를 얻을 수도 있었다. 그걸 베이컨과 바꿔 버렸다. 그럴 가치가 있었을까? 아마도. 베이컨은 꽤 맛있으니까."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df"
msgid "SOME PIG"
msgstr "대단한 돼지"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df:122
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df"
msgid ""
"There's a spider web on the ceiling.\r\n"
"\tThis is EXACTLY like Charlotte's Web.\r\n"
"\tThe pig squints at "
msgstr ""
"천장에 거미줄이 있다.\r\n"
"\t딱 '샬롯의 거미줄' 같다.\r\n"
"\t돼지가 실눈을 뜨고 쳐다본다: "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df"
msgid ""
". Pigs are well known for their flavor and their constant hopping around. "
"They can't drive cars."
msgstr ". 돼지는 맛과 쉴 새 없이 깡충거리는 걸로 유명하다. 차는 못 몬다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df"
msgid "Leave it alone for now"
msgstr "일단 내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df:126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df"
msgid "Recruit Pig"
msgstr "돼지를 영입한다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/farm.df"
msgid ": BETRAY PIG"
msgstr ": 돼지를 배신한다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid "Friend of All Dogs"
msgstr "모든 개의 친구"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid " uses everything "
msgstr "은(는) 총동원한다. "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid ""
" knows about dog psychology on this vicious junkyard dog!\r\n"
"\t\tIt works! The dog wants to follow!"
msgstr ""
"가 아는 개 심리학을 이 사나운 고물상 개에게 전부!\r\n"
"\t\t효과가 있다! 개가 따라오고 싶어 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid "Have dog follow"
msgstr "개를 데려간다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid "Leave it here for now"
msgstr "일단 여기 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:17
#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid "Very Mean Dog"
msgstr "아주 사나운 개"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid "The dog is having none of that. It lunges at "
msgstr "개는 전혀 넘어오지 않는다. 덤벼든다: "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid ""
"It's a vicious junkyard dog that wants nothing to do with you. This dog's personality probably wasn't great before the apocalypse, either.\r\n"
"\tIt's too feral to even be swayed by food."
msgstr ""
"사나운 고물상 개다. 너희와 엮이고 싶은 마음이 전혀 없다. 이 개 성격은 종말 전에도 별로였을 거다.\r\n"
"\t너무 야생적이라 먹이로도 꼬드길 수 없다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid "WARNING: Will probably bite you."
msgstr "경고: 아마 물릴 거다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid "WARNING: Will absolutely kill you."
msgstr "경고: 무조건 죽는다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid "Bribe dog with a bone"
msgstr "뼈다귀로 개를 매수한다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid "Make dog follow you"
msgstr "개를 따라오게 만든다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid "Get killed by dog"
msgstr "개한테 죽는다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid "Use DOG PSYCHOLOGY"
msgstr "개 심리학 사용"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid "Leave dog alone for now"
msgstr "일단 개는 내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid "Junkyard Pal Leonard"
msgstr "고물상 친구 레너드"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid " needs help! If you get him out of here alive, he will teach "
msgstr "은(는) 도움이 필요하다! 살려서 데리고 나가면 가르쳐 준다고 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid ""
" some shooting tips.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"에게 사격 요령을.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid "H..help! I'm freaking out right now!"
msgstr "도, 도와줘! 나 지금 완전 패닉이야!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid "Junkyard Pal Clem"
msgstr "고물상 친구 클렘"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid " asks for help! If you can get him out of here, he'll teach "
msgstr "은(는) 도움을 청한다! 여기서 데리고 나가 주면 가르쳐 준다고 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid ""
" everything he knows about car repair.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"에게 차 수리에 대해 아는 모든 걸.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/junk-maker.df"
msgid ""
"Things have been bad since our car broke down. It doesn't matter how good "
"you are, cars break down fast on these roads!"
msgstr "차가 고장 난 뒤로 상황이 안 좋아. 아무리 실력이 좋아도, 이런 길에선 차가 금방 망가져!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df"
msgid "Quiet Farm"
msgstr "조용한 농장"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df"
msgid ""
" finds a farm. It looks like it was abandoned in a hurry, long ago.\r\n"
"\tThere should be some field tools left behind."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 농장을 발견한다. 오래전에 급히 버려진 것 같다.\r\n"
"\t농기구가 좀 남아 있을 거다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df"
msgid "Visit Farm"
msgstr "농장에 들른다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df"
msgid "a little chicken"
msgstr "작은 닭"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df"
msgid "some pig"
msgstr "돼지 한 마리"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df"
msgid "Chicken Rescue"
msgstr "닭 구출"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df"
msgid "Pig Rescue"
msgstr "돼지 구출"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df"
msgid " drives near a farm. A large crowd of zombies slowly chase "
msgstr "은(는) 농장 근처를 지나간다. 큰 좀비 떼가 천천히 "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df"
msgid " into a barn."
msgstr "을(를) 헛간 안으로 몰아넣고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/outside1.df"
msgid "Save the Animal"
msgstr "동물을 구한다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/park.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/park.df"
msgid "Bathroom Break"
msgstr "화장실 휴식"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/park.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/park.df"
msgid " survived "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/park.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/park.df"
msgid " mission of finding a bathroom. Then "
msgstr " 화장실 찾기 임무에서 살아남았다. 그런데 "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/park.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/park.df"
msgid ""
" got surrounded by the nearby hordes.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"는 근처 좀비 떼에 둘러싸이고 말았다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/park.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/park.df"
msgid " asks if "
msgstr "는 묻는다. "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/park.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/park.df"
msgid " can follow you around."
msgstr "가 따라가도 되냐고."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/park.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/park.df"
msgid ""
"There were too many zombies in the other bathroom! I think I dropped my car "
"keys in there."
msgstr "다른 화장실엔 좀비가 너무 많았어! 거기에 차 열쇠를 떨어뜨린 것 같아."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/park.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/park.df"
msgid "Let "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/park.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/park.df"
msgid " follow you"
msgstr "를 데려간다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/park.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/park.df"
msgid "Leave "
msgstr "일단 "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/park.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/park.df"
msgid " for now"
msgstr "를 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/cabin1-bear.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/cabin1-bear.df"
msgid ""
" grapples with the stuffed bear.\r\n"
"\tIt doesn't budge. "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 박제 곰과 씨름한다.\r\n"
"\t꿈쩍도 안 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/cabin1-bear.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/cabin1-bear.df"
msgid ""
" keeps wrestling with the bear, and somehow absorbs a little bit of its "
"strength.."
msgstr "는 계속 곰과 씨름하다가, 어째선지 그 힘을 조금 흡수한다.."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/cabin1-bear.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/cabin1-bear.df"
msgid ""
" searches the stuffed bear on a hunch.\r\n"
"\tHey! There was a bunch of food and medical supplies hidden in a flap behind it!"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 감으로 박제 곰을 뒤진다.\r\n"
"\t오! 뒤쪽 덮개 안에 식량과 의약품이 잔뜩 숨겨져 있었다!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/cabin1-bear.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/cabin1-bear.df"
msgid "Stuffed Bear"
msgstr "박제 곰"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/cabin1-bear.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/cabin1-bear.df"
msgid "A huge stuffed bear looms in the cabin."
msgstr "오두막 안에 거대한 박제 곰이 우뚝 서 있다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/cabin1-bear.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/cabin1-bear.df"
msgid " wrestles it for a few hours"
msgstr "이(가) 몇 시간 동안 씨름한다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/cabin1-bear.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/cabin1-bear.df"
msgid " searches the bear quickly"
msgstr "이(가) 곰을 재빨리 뒤진다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/cabin1-bear.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/cabin1-bear.df"
msgid "Leave it for now"
msgstr "일단 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid "GIVE 'ER!"
msgstr "밟아!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid "Onward to Canada!"
msgstr "캐나다로!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:20
#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid "ZOMBO POINTS"
msgstr "좀보 포인트"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid " Maximum increased to 15!"
msgstr " 최대치가 15로 증가!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid " Maximum increased to 20!"
msgstr " 최대치가 20으로 증가!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid "The "
msgstr "윌 유 카인들리 팀의 "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid "honor"
msgstr "명예"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid " and "
msgstr "와 "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid "reputation"
msgstr "명성"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid " of the Would You Kindly team is saved by "
msgstr "을(를) 지켜 낸 건 바로 "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:97
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid "Here are some codes to celebrate!"
msgstr "축하 기념 코드다!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid "NICE ONE, DINGUS"
msgstr "잘했다, 멍청아"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:112
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid " You've somehow murdered the "
msgstr " 어쩌다 보니 살해해 버렸다: "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:112
